    skos:scopeNote "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0351 (Fisheries Articles Unenumerated). Attested in: P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 439."@en ;
    <ontology/attestationBasis/#resource> "document_attested" ;
